  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/577",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">디자인을 활용한 수업은</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">,</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 창의성을 맘껏 발휘할 수 있는 장</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">場</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">예술과의 융합 수업에 적용 가능</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이었고요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기권과 날씨 단원 첫 시간</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(2434</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">방에 원진아 선생님의 날씨 캐릭터 그리기 수업이 있습니다.</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">), </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자유학기제 수업</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">시험 끝나고 방학 앞둔 기간에 도입 추천합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오래전</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, &lt;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기상 전문 채널의 기획</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">홍보실 직원이 되어 기상 단원 탐구하기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&gt;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">라는 제목 아래 네 가지 주제로 수업하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기상 전문 채널의 우리말 이름 짓기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;용오름</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">꽃구름</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">하늬바람</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">무지개</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">명지바람</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">부드럽고 화창한 바람</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">…</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">어린이를 위한 기상학습 코너 만들기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;할머니가 들려주는 날씨 속담</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">구름을 의인화하기</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생활</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기상</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지수 만들기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;기존의 생활지수를 새롭게 디자인하기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생활지수 창작하기</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">분야별 전문 기상캐스터 초빙하기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;특별한 날</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">각종 기념일과 국경일</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, 24</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">절기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">장마철 등</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">의 의미를 살릴 수 있는 기상캐스터 찾기 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">⇒ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">일기예보 화면 만들기</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">언젠가부터 기상 단원에서 생활지수는 다루지 않고</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">구성도 많이 바뀌습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그렇지만 기상 단원뿐 아니라 다른 주제에도 응용 가능하다고 생각하여, 예전 학생들의 산출물을 간략하게 소개합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생활지수 외 산출물은 디자인과 관련된 것만 소개합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오래되어 자료가 많이 소실되었어요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">남은 것 중에서 올려볼게요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">구름을 의인화하기 </span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d28f6738a49f09f5ec7452e170eaaedc4ae821d7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d28f6738a49f09f5ec7452e170eaaedc4ae821d7\" data-origin-width=\"705\" data-origin-height=\"485\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생활지수 만들기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">① </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기존의 생활지수를 새롭게 디자인하기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160; - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">나들이지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">높음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6618232b8204b53d3a01036b0b6a54ea1399281\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6618232b8204b53d3a01036b0b6a54ea1399281\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160; - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">빨래지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">세차지수</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fad575b2226caa098ee9a82bebd492db07db558b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fad575b2226caa098ee9a82bebd492db07db558b\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">② </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생활지수 창작하기</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160; - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모내기지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모판으로 높은 정도 구분</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c388cd55ab61085d0d0a8b493c33f0ea96227638\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c388cd55ab61085d0d0a8b493c33f0ea96227638\" data-origin-width=\"500\" data-origin-height=\"319\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;- </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추수지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">높음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">보통</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">낮음</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/353fdfa6fb7d42fb005e6976d3931c4e61e0f40d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/353fdfa6fb7d42fb005e6976d3931c4e61e0f40d\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;- </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">축구지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">높음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">보통</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">낮음</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; ※ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">남학교에서 가장 인기 높았던 지수</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33c706dcbd2ffa759a75acd4a5414579f720a37a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33c706dcbd2ffa759a75acd4a5414579f720a37a\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;- </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">반려견과 산책지수</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">높음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">보통</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">낮음</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e3a7ca36d1bef278b6fdf0adeba2bc50b335c30\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e3a7ca36d1bef278b6fdf0adeba2bc50b335c30\" data-origin-width=\"241\" data-origin-height=\"285\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">분야별 전문 기상캐스터 초빙하기 </span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">특별한 날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">초빙할 분야별 전문가</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">삼일절</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">유관순 열사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가상 기상캐스터</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">벚꽃이 절정인 봄날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">디자이너 앙드레 김</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">당시는 생존</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">석가탄신일</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">동자승</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">소만</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">모내기에 좋은 날</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">신세대 멋쟁이 농부</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">불쾌지수 높은 날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">신바람 황수관 박사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">당시는 생존</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">백중사리</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">서산 바닷가에 사는 아주머니</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">청명한 가을날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">한시에 능한 할아버지</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">한글날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">세종대왕</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가상 기상캐스터</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">국군의 날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">군인</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">크리스마스</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">산타할아버지</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가상 기상캐스터</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">철새 탐사하기 좋은 날</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">윤무부 박사</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/873d7845431c2967be64a9194fa10526ae5cff2e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/873d7845431c2967be64a9194fa10526ae5cff2e\" data-origin-width=\"945\" data-origin-height=\"325\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdc55eb0377e5d9f6dc2785739e99ec62df7dae4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdc55eb0377e5d9f6dc2785739e99ec62df7dae4\" data-origin-width=\"853\" data-origin-height=\"312\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">※ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">디자이너 앙드레 김의 일기예보</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;으음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">~ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오늘은 차</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">~</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">암 퍼펙트하고 엘레강스한 날이에요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오늘의 날씨는 바람이 스무스하고 프리티하게 불면서 또오</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">으음</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">~ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">구름이 끼지 않아 베리 베리 뷰티풀하겠어요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">따스한 햇살이 다이나믹하게 비치는 요즘</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">럭셔리한 벚꽃이 한창이네요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
